[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.02,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Welcome back to Sessions Sentier.",
    "char_start": 16,
    "char_end": 49,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1.02,
    "end": 4.73,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail building, and I'm joined by Julien Mercier, a trail builder from the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 50,
    "char_end": 170,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.73,
    "end": 6.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Julien Mercier, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 171,
    "char_end": 212,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 7.21,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Thank you, Camille.",
    "char_start": 229,
    "char_end": 248,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.21,
    "end": 12.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "My pleasure – trail construction is a topic I've given a lot of thought to.",
    "char_start": 249,
    "char_end": 324,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.0,
    "end": 14.46,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "This episode is brought to you by Strava.",
    "char_start": 341,
    "char_end": 382,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.46,
    "end": 16.32,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 383,
    "char_end": 414,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.32,
    "end": 18.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Start at strava.com/podcast.",
    "char_start": 415,
    "char_end": 443,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.0,
    "end": 21.04,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 444,
    "char_end": 485,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.04,
    "end": 24.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 486,
    "char_end": 526,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.0,
    "end": 26.13,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Honestly, drainage is the most crucial design decision for any trail.",
    "char_start": 543,
    "char_end": 612,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.13,
    "end": 27.87,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Alliance Cascadia.",
    "char_start": 613,
    "char_end": 669,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.87,
    "end": 30.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 670,
    "char_end": 739,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 32.62,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
    "char_start": 756,
    "char_end": 794,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.62,
    "end": 36.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
    "char_start": 795,
    "char_end": 844,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.0,
    "end": 39.51,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Yes, listen – the most common mistake that beginner builders make is digging with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 861,
    "char_end": 961,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.51,
    "end": 42.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become much easier.",
    "char_start": 962,
    "char_end": 1033,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.0,
    "end": 43.77,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper.",
    "char_start": 1050,
    "char_end": 1073,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 43.77,
    "end": 48.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1074,
    "char_end": 1129,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.0,
    "end": 48.28,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Of course.",
    "char_start": 1146,
    "char_end": 1156,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.28,
    "end": 50.85,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Discussions about land management should take place before the first shovel hits the ground.",
    "char_start": 1157,
    "char_end": 1249,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.85,
    "end": 52.05,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
    "char_start": 1250,
    "char_end": 1293,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.05,
    "end": 54.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
    "char_start": 1294,
    "char_end": 1364,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 60.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Tell me more.",
    "char_start": 1381,
    "char_end": 1394,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 66.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within this workflow, the trade-offs become apparent. If you ignore these trade-offs, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1411,
    "char_end": 1602,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.0,
    "end": 68.45,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
    "char_start": 1619,
    "char_end": 1657,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.45,
    "end": 72.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1658,
    "char_end": 1713,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.0,
    "end": 72.31,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Of course.",
    "char_start": 1730,
    "char_end": 1740,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.31,
    "end": 73.81,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "The benches along the hillside are not optional.",
    "char_start": 1741,
    "char_end": 1789,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 73.81,
    "end": 75.78,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first year is the ravine of the third year.",
    "char_start": 1790,
    "char_end": 1853,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.78,
    "end": 78.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 1854,
    "char_end": 1925,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.0,
    "end": 80.13,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "This is a useful framework.",
    "char_start": 1942,
    "char_end": 1969,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 80.13,
    "end": 84.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
    "char_start": 1970,
    "char_end": 2019,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.0,
    "end": 86.48,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Yes, listen – the structure of the team is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 2036,
    "char_end": 2114,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.48,
    "end": 88.03,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 2115,
    "char_end": 2164,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 88.03,
    "end": 90.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2165,
    "char_end": 2227,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 90.0,
    "end": 92.06,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 2244,
    "char_end": 2281,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 92.06,
    "end": 96.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What is the structural aspect that most auditors do not have access to?",
    "char_start": 2282,
    "char_end": 2353,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.0,
    "end": 97.62,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Let me tell you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 2370,
    "char_end": 2422,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.62,
    "end": 100.06,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "I've changed my mind about machine-made trails compared to those made by hand.",
    "char_start": 2423,
    "char_end": 2501,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.06,
    "end": 102.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2502,
    "char_end": 2564,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.0,
    "end": 108.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Tell me more.",
    "char_start": 2581,
    "char_end": 2594,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.0,
    "end": 114.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "And when teams adopt the Cascadia Alliance within this process, the trade-offs become apparent. If you ignore these trade-offs, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2611,
    "char_end": 2805,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.0,
    "end": 120.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2822,
    "char_end": 2873,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.0,
    "end": 121.43,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Today's episode is brought to you by Stripe.",
    "char_start": 2886,
    "char_end": 2930,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.43,
    "end": 124.63,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Stripe simplifies payments, whether you're running a marketplace or a subscription-based business.",
    "char_start": 2931,
    "char_end": 3029,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.63,
    "end": 126.0,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Visit stripe.com/podcast for a free trial.",
    "char_start": 3030,
    "char_end": 3072,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.0,
    "end": 127.28,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Welcome back to the show.",
    "char_start": 3089,
    "char_end": 3114,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.28,
    "end": 129.18,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 3115,
    "char_end": 3152,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.18,
    "end": 132.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3153,
    "char_end": 3208,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.0,
    "end": 132.55,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "That's how I see it.",
    "char_start": 3225,
    "char_end": 3245,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.55,
    "end": 134.16,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Drainage is the most crucial design decision for any trail.",
    "char_start": 3246,
    "char_end": 3305,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.16,
    "end": 135.56,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "We've seen it in teams that use Shimano components.",
    "char_start": 3306,
    "char_end": 3357,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.56,
    "end": 138.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3358,
    "char_end": 3447,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.0,
    "end": 140.92,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
    "char_start": 3464,
    "char_end": 3502,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.92,
    "end": 144.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 3503,
    "char_end": 3543,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.0,
    "end": 147.51,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Yes, listen – the most common mistake that beginner builders make is digging with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 3560,
    "char_end": 3660,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.51,
    "end": 150.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become much easier.",
    "char_start": 3661,
    "char_end": 3732,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.0,
    "end": 151.74,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Challenge my conventional wisdom.",
    "char_start": 3749,
    "char_end": 3782,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.74,
    "end": 156.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What did you used to believe about this, and what have you revised your views on?",
    "char_start": 3783,
    "char_end": 3864,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.0,
    "end": 157.22,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 3881,
    "char_end": 3933,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.22,
    "end": 159.39,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Discussions about land management should take place before the first shovel hits the ground.",
    "char_start": 3934,
    "char_end": 4026,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.39,
    "end": 160.54,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 4027,
    "char_end": 4076,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.54,
    "end": 162.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4077,
    "char_end": 4139,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.0,
    "end": 168.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "It's settled.\nOr:\nIt's a done deal.\nOr:\nThat's confirmed.\nOr:\nIt's arranged.\nOr:\nIt's agreed.\n(The best option depends on the context.)",
    "char_start": 4156,
    "char_end": 4291,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.0,
    "end": 171.68,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Outside of the tools available at the Cascadia Alliance level, it is more difficult to identify the failure mode.",
    "char_start": 4308,
    "char_end": 4421,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.68,
    "end": 174.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 4422,
    "char_end": 4493,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.0,
    "end": 176.95,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What heuristic do you always find yourself returning to?",
    "char_start": 4510,
    "char_end": 4566,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.95,
    "end": 180.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Which version of the question is truly the most important?",
    "char_start": 4567,
    "char_end": 4625,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 182.03,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "It boils down to this: benches along the hillside are not optional.",
    "char_start": 4642,
    "char_end": 4709,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.03,
    "end": 184.12,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first year leads to the ravine of the third year.",
    "char_start": 4710,
    "char_end": 4779,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.12,
    "end": 186.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4780,
    "char_end": 4842,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.0,
    "end": 188.27,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 4859,
    "char_end": 4896,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.27,
    "end": 192.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 4897,
    "char_end": 4958,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.0,
    "end": 193.33,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 4975,
    "char_end": 5027,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 193.33,
    "end": 194.97,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "The structure of the soil is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 5028,
    "char_end": 5092,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.97,
    "end": 196.41,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Alliance Cascadia.",
    "char_start": 5093,
    "char_end": 5149,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.41,
    "end": 198.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 5150,
    "char_end": 5212,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.0,
    "end": 200.23,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper.",
    "char_start": 5229,
    "char_end": 5252,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.23,
    "end": 204.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 5253,
    "char_end": 5292,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.0,
    "end": 207.41,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Yes, listen – I've changed my mind about machine-made trails versus those made by hand.",
    "char_start": 5309,
    "char_end": 5396,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.41,
    "end": 210.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5397,
    "char_end": 5463,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 216.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "char_start": 5480,
    "char_end": 5507,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.0,
    "end": 219.57,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Outside of issues related to RockShox components, the failure mode is more difficult to identify.",
    "char_start": 5524,
    "char_end": 5621,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.57,
    "end": 222.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5622,
    "char_end": 5688,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.0,
    "end": 228.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to the management of the territory.",
    "char_start": 5705,
    "char_end": 5804,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.0,
    "end": 234.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises surrounding land management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5821,
    "char_end": 5962,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.0,
    "end": 235.42,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper.",
    "char_start": 5979,
    "char_end": 6002,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 235.42,
    "end": 240.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "char_start": 6003,
    "char_end": 6077,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.0,
    "end": 242.23,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "It all boils down to this: drainage is the most crucial design decision for any trail.",
    "char_start": 6094,
    "char_end": 6180,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.23,
    "end": 243.69,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox components.",
    "char_start": 6181,
    "char_end": 6237,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.69,
    "end": 246.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6238,
    "char_end": 6327,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.0,
    "end": 248.27,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 6344,
    "char_end": 6381,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.27,
    "end": 252.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 6382,
    "char_end": 6443,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.0,
    "end": 255.27,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that beginner builders make is digging with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 6460,
    "char_end": 6556,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.27,
    "end": 258.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "char_start": 6557,
    "char_end": 6637,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.0,
    "end": 264.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
    "char_start": 6654,
    "char_end": 6725,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.0,
    "end": 268.21,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6742,
    "char_end": 6810,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.21,
    "end": 270.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6811,
    "char_end": 6840,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.0,
    "end": 272.08,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6857,
    "char_end": 6912,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.08,
    "end": 274.91,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "char_start": 6913,
    "char_end": 6988,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 274.91,
    "end": 276.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Check them out at linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6989,
    "char_end": 7018,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.0,
    "end": 282.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "Julien Mercier, thank you for this conversation.",
    "char_start": 7019,
    "char_end": 7067,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.0,
    "end": 288.0,
    "speaker_label": "Julien Mercier",
    "text": "Thank you, Camille.",
    "char_start": 7084,
    "char_end": 7103,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.0,
    "end": 292.43,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of Sessions Sentier.",
    "char_start": 7120,
    "char_end": 7171,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.43,
    "end": 294.0,
    "speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "char_start": 7172,
    "char_end": 7190,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
